{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_handoff_prose_pass", "label": "HANDOFF \u2014 main-volume prose pass", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explicitly not a build handoff: the prose pass writes review files and never touches source or the Register."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_prose_rewrite_task", "label": "The main-volume prose rewrite for a skeptical reader", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_integrity_rule", "label": "Integrity rule \u2014 the math is the math", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every number, equation and section reference is carried verbatim and shorthand is expanded, so a readability rewrite cannot let meaning drift."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_cut_workshop", "label": "Standing rule 1 \u2014 cut workshop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Material about the work on the book is cut from the reader-facing volume but preserved in the working record, because it earned the confidence the results are stated with and it feeds the compendium expansions."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_mc_token_binding", "label": "Standing rule 2 \u2014 proof/claim bound to a compendium by [MC-NN]", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The main volume reads as a finished citation and never says 'owed'; a missing expansion becomes a new owed row rather than inline authoring."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_renumber_last", "label": "Standing rule 3 \u2014 renumber last, in one sweep", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Numbers stay at current source values while drafting so cross-reference cascades are resolved once, in a dedicated pass, instead of drifting per chapter."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_confirmation_questions", "label": "Standing rule 5 \u2014 confirmation questions for ungrounded readings", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A conversational reading that would reshape a chapter is not written on that basis; it becomes a grounded question carried to the original-works project."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_preface_spine", "label": "The Preface 'How far the method reaches' as the spine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The method is the protagonist and 14D, the seed, the clock, the arrows and time are payoffs it produced: build, close, read the defect, record every failure."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_fourteen_d_boundary", "label": "14D \u2014 the unwitnessable observation boundary", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bounded, not built: the 14th axis always collapses to 1D and is definable only from outside by observation, which makes it the founding seed rather than an object."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_observation_frame_time", "label": "Observation frame for time (M's ruling)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The section 6.2 arrow and the section 11 no-arrow are the same object seen from two observational frames; observation selects the frame and the arrow is real within it."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_ninth_axis_self_closing", "label": "Ninth axis \u2014 the self-closing moment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_void_transition_watch", "label": "Active watch \u2014 void / transition / dimension", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ungrounded as written and refuted by the void verdict, but held open by M: if grounding is found written or becomes derivable it is flagged and built in."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_time_paper_absorption", "label": "Time-paper absorption, concluded", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_handoff_5_owed_expansions", "label": "OWED-EXPANSIONS.md \u2014 35 [MC-01..MC-35] rows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/HANDOFF-5.